# GitHub Linguist Configuration (.gitattributes)
# Accurately reflect actual software engineering (Python and C++ firmware)
# and prevent non-code assets (CSVs, HTML templates, docs) from skewing stats.

# 1. Simulation Flight Datasets & Test Fixtures (Data, not code)
test_cases/* linguist-vendored
*.csv linguist-vendored

# 2. Web UI Ground Station Viewport (Presentation template)
index.html linguist-vendored

# 3. Microcontroller Firmware Recognition (C++)
*.ino linguist-language=C++
*.h linguist-language=C++

# 4. Project Documentation
docs/* linguist-documentation
*.md linguist-documentation
*.txt linguist-documentation
tasks.txt linguist-documentation
